Description:
 linuxmuster-tools7 - Tools for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-tools7 (7.4.15) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [ldapconnector] Printer members are now added and removed in a single
     targeted LDAP modify instead of rewriting the whole member list: two
     changes landing at the same time can no longer overwrite each other.
     LMNPrinter.add_members()/remove_members() take users as well as
     groups and report their failures like the group writers do.
   * [ldapconnector] Fix ValueError when the last member of a group was
     removed: an empty member list now goes through delattr(). Reported by
     @juergen.
   * [ldapconnector] A failed LDAP write while adding a member now reaches
     the caller instead of being logged and reported as a success.
   * [ldapconnector] Fix the parent group lookup for student logins
     containing a dot. Merge pull request #31 from @Maddi02.
   * [lmnfile] ConfigLoader accepts negative values: a quota of -1 stayed a
     string and left the quota tab empty. Reported by @juergen.
   * [linbo] image.status: the three duplicated parsers are merged into
     one, timestamps are exposed as UTC epoch, a missing or malformed
     status file no longer raises, and file names are matched
     case-insensitively. Reported by @TomS.
   * [linbo] scan_hosts() no longer returns lastSeen: it held the time of
     the probe, not a last-seen date. Recording it is the caller's job.
   * [linbo] parse_linbo_startconf() flushes the last stanza. Fix #29,
     reported by @TomlDev. Group listing is decoupled from start.conf
     parsing and exposed through the new group_ids attribute.
   * [linbo] Move the unused LinboImageSync class to WIP.
   * [common] New NameChecker.validate(), used wherever a name is used to
     build a path.
   * [schoolclasses] The <class>-teachers/-students/-parents subgroups are
     now kept in sync in sophomorixAdmins too, can be deleted, and their
     orphans detected after a kill. New SchoolClassExistError.
   * [install-scripts] Student groups are checked for every school and the
     attic is excluded. The sophomorix hooks no longer abort on a single
     failure and drop a deprecated school parameter.
